                    \\downarrow^{\mathrlap{f}}_{\mathrlap{\in Fib}}
                    \\\
                    id \colon &amp; B &amp;\longrightarrow&amp; Y &amp;\underset{\phantom{AAAA}}{\longrightarrow}&amp; B
                    }
                    \\,,
            %p
              where
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi s
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} s
              is uniquely defined and where
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi t
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} t
              is any lift of the top middle vertical acyclic cofibration against
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi f
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi f
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f
              as a retract of an acyclic fibration. These are closed under retract by
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "weak+factorization+system#ClosuredPropertiesOfWeakFactorizationSystem"} this prop.
            %p
              Now consider the general case. Factor
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi f
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f
              as an acyclic cofibration followed by a fibration and form the pushout in the top left square of the following diagram
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
                      %mtable
                        %mtr
                          %mtd
                            %mi id
                            %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace"} :
                          %mtd
                            %mi A
                          %mtd
                            %mo ⟶
                          %mtd
                            %mi X
                          %mtd
                            %mover
                              %mo ⟶
                              %mphantom
                                %mi AAAA
                          %mtd
                            %mi A
                        %mtr
                          %mtd
                          %mtd
                            %msup
                              %mrow
                              %mpadded{:lspace => "-100%width", :width => "0"}
                                %mrow
                                  %mo ∈
                                  %mi W
                                  %mo ∩
                                  %mi Cof
                            %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ↓
                          %mtd
                            %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                            %mi po
                            %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                          %mtd
                            %msup
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ↓
                              %mpadded{:width => "0"}
                                %mrow
                                  %mo ∈
                                  %mi W
                                  %mo ∩
                                  %mi Cof
                          %mtd
                          %mtd
                            %msup
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ↓
                              %mpadded{:width => "0"}
                                %mrow
                                  %mo ∈
                                  %mi W
                                  %mo ∩
                                  %mi Cof
                        %mtr
                          %mtd
                            %mi id
                            %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace"} :
                          %mtd
                            %mi A
                            %mo ′
                          %mtd
                            %mover
                              %mo ⟶
                              %mrow
                          %mtd
                            %mi X
                            %mo ′
                          %mtd
                            %mover
                              %mo ⟶
                              %mrow
                                %mphantom
                                  %mi AA
                                %mphantom
                                  %mi AA
                          %mtd
                            %mi A
                            %mo ′
                        %mtr
                          %mtd
                          %mtd
                            %msup
                              %mrow
                              %mpadded{:lspace => "-100%width", :width => "0"}
                                %mrow
                                  %mo ∈
                                  %mi Fib
                            %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ↓
                          %mtd
                          %mtd
                            %msup
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ↓
                              %mpadded{:width => "0"}
                                %mrow
                                  %mo ∈
                                  %mi W
                          %mtd
                          %mtd
                            %msup
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ↓
                              %mpadded{:width => "0"}
                                %mrow
                                  %mo ∈
                                  %mi Fib
                        %mtr
                          %mtd
                            %mi id
                            %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace"} :
                          %mtd
                            %mi B
                          %mtd
