            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/joyalscatlab/published/HomePage"}> Joyal's CatLab
              ,
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/joyalscatlab/published/Model+categories"} Model categories
          %p and appendix E of
          %ul
            %li#Joyal
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andr%C3%A9+Joyal"}> André Joyal
              ,
              %em The theory of quasi-categories and its applications
              (
              %a{:href => "http://mat.uab.cat/~kock/crm/hocat/advanced-course/Quadern45-2.pdf"}> pdf
              ,
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/JoyalTheoryOfQuasicategories.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            The version of the definition in (
            %a{:href => "#Joyal"}> Joyal
            ) is also highlighted in
          %ul
            %li#Riehl09
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Emily+Riehl"}> Emily Riehl
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em A concise definition of model category
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.jhu.edu/~eriehl/modelcat.pdf"} pdf
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/RiehlConciseDefinitionOfModelCategory.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p An introductory survey of some key concepts is in the set of slides
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+May"}> Peter May
              ,
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/ModelCatPrimer.pdf", :title => "Model Category Primer"} Model Category Primer
          %p
            There is an unpublished manuscript of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chris+Reedy"} Chris Reedy
            from around 1974 that’s been circulating as an increasingly faded photocopy. It’s been typed into LaTeX, and the author has given
            %a{:href => "http://www-math.mit.edu/~psh/#Other%20mathematics"} permission
            for it to be posted on the net:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chris+Reedy"}> Chris Reedy
              ,
              %em Homotopy theory of model categories
              (
              %a{:href => "http://www-math.mit.edu/~psh/reedy.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p See
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Philip+Hirschhorn"}> Philip Hirschhorn
              , personal website:
              %em
                %a{:href => "http://www-math.mit.edu/~psh/#Mathematics"} Mathematics
          %p for errata and more.
